    "question_sha256": "4f5a27d54d95158318f2cc3f58b52c7dfb5993e0c37144170d3482720e2692fe",
    "responses": [
      {
        "key": "gsm8k-train-5729:rich",
        "raw_call_sha256": "f4e26fb1448ef192d2d0a0c1da35bbba364870da46a00be102d35511e1afb525",
        "student_prefix": [
          {
            "content": "Milly is making feather boas for her dance team. Each flamingo has 20 tail feathers, and it's only safe to pluck 25% of their tail feathers at one time. If Milly needs to make 12 boas, and each boa has 200 feathers, how many flamingoes does she need to harvest?",
